  "title": "Spicy Salsa",
  "description": "Four jalapeno peppers are diced and mixed into this very tomato salsa, so it 's quite nippy. And there 's a bit of garlic and cilantro to help it along as well. It 's finished with a splash of lime juice and chilled until ready to serve. Makes three cups.",
